        "title": "Setup the Development Environment",
        "description": "<p class=\"font-size-13  muted-80\"><strong>Pre-Requisites<\/strong><\/p>\n<p class=\"font-size-13  muted-80\">- Source Control must be setup already from the production environment.<\/p>\n<p class=\"font-size-13  muted-80\">- Source Control Connector must already be configured with privileges to access and write on the Production Content and Development Settings repositories<\/p>\n<p class=\"font-size-13  muted-80\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p class=\"font-size-13  muted-80\"><strong>Setup the Development Environment<\/strong><\/p>\n<p class=\"font-size-13  muted-80\">Setting up the source control&nbsp;for the development environment entails the following:<\/p>\n<ol class=\"font-size-13 muted-80\">\n<li class=\"font-size-13  muted-80\">Maps logged in FortiSOAR user to specified Source Control user account.<\/li>\n<li class=\"font-size-13 muted-80\">Connects to a source control service and identify following repositories\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha;\">\n<li>Production Content<\/li>\n<li>Development Settings<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"font-size-13  muted-80\">Following <a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"\/editor\/exporter\/templates\">Export Templates<\/a> that define content to be saved in the source control repositories.\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha;\">\n<li>Source Control - Production Content<\/li>\n<li>Source Control - Development Settings<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"font-size-13  muted-80\">Applies latest content on this box. At this step, this development instance would like identical to production instances from the content standpoint.<\/li>\n<\/ol>",
